on Oxides), CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide), CI 15850 (Red 7 Lake), CI 19140 (Yellow 5 Lake), CI 15850 (Red 6 Lake).<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
